#. translators: Gallery template name shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:29
msgid "Detailed Receipt"
msgstr "상세 영수증"

#. translators: Gallery template description shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:31
msgid ""
"Extended info with SKU, unit price, full tax breakdown, customer address, and cashier details."
msgstr "SKU, 단가, 전체 세금 내역, 고객 주소, 계산원 정보가 포함된 확장 정보."

#. translators: Gallery template description shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:44
msgid ""
"Items listed without prices. Includes gift message from customer note and return reference."
msgstr "가격 없이 항목만 표시합니다. 고객 메모의 선물 메시지와 반품 참조를 포함합니다."

#. translators: Gallery template description shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:57
msgid ""
"Full-page A4/Letter invoice with bill-to/ship-to addresses, an itemised products table, and an optional \"How to pay\" panel (bank transfer + QR-encoded order-pay URL) shown when the order still needs payment."
msgstr ""
"청구지/배송지 주소, 항목별 제품 표, 그리고 주문이 아직 결제되지 않았을 때 표시되는 선택적 \"결제 방법\" 패널(은행 송금 + QR로 인코딩된 order-pay URL)이 포함된 A4/Letter 전체 페이지 송장."

#. translators: Gallery template name shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:68
msgid "Minimal / Modern"
msgstr "미니멀 / 모던"

#. translators: Gallery template description shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:70
msgid ""
"Compact receipt with a centered store header, bold double-border order band and dense item rows. Same essentials as Standard, less vertical space."
msgstr ""
"가운데 정렬된 매장 헤더, 굵은 이중 테두리 주문 구역, 촘촘한 항목 행이 있는 컴팩트 영수증. Standard와 같은 핵심 요소를 더 적은 세로 공간에 담았습니다."

#. translators: Gallery template name shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:81
msgid "Narrow Receipt"
msgstr "좁은 영수증"

#. translators: Gallery template description shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:83
msgid ""
"Compact monospace receipt sized for narrow paper or HTML-capable thermal printers. Prints cleanly in black and white."
msgstr "좁은 용지나 HTML 지원 감열식 프린터용 컴팩트 모노스페이스 영수증입니다. 흑백으로도 깔끔하게 인쇄됩니다."

#. translators: Gallery template description shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:95
msgid ""
"Fulfillment companion with items and quantities only. No pricing. Shipping address prominent."
msgstr "항목과 수량만 있는 배송용 보조 문서입니다. 가격은 표시하지 않습니다. 배송지 주소가 눈에 잘 띄게 배치됩니다."

#. translators: Gallery template name shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:106
msgid "Quote / Estimate"
msgstr "견적 / 추정서"

#. translators: Gallery template description shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:108
msgid ""
"Pre-sale document with items and pricing. No payment section. Includes validity notice and terms."
msgstr "항목과 가격이 포함된 판매 전 문서입니다. 결제 섹션은 없습니다. 유효 기간 안내와 약관이 포함됩니다."

#. translators: Gallery template name shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:119
msgid "Standard Receipt"
msgstr "표준 영수증"

#. translators: Gallery template description shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:121
msgid ""
"Streamlined receipt with logo, store info, itemized lines, totals and payment — covers what most stores need without the kitchen sink."
msgstr "로고, 매장 정보, 항목별 내역, 합계, 결제가 포함된 간결한 영수증입니다. 대부분의 매장에 필요한 핵심만 담았습니다."

#. translators: Gallery template name shown in the admin Template Gallery. The (RTL) suffix marks right-to-left layout.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:132
msgid "Standard Receipt (RTL)"
msgstr "표준 영수증 (RTL)"

#. translators: Gallery template description shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:134
msgid ""
"Right-to-left version of the Standard Receipt for Arabic, Hebrew, Persian and Urdu sites. Mirrors layout and uses an RTL-friendly font stack."
msgstr ""
"아랍어, 히브리어, 페르시아어, 우르두어 사이트용 표준 영수증의 오른쪽에서 왼쪽(RTL) 버전입니다. 레이아웃을 반전하고 RTL에 적합한 글꼴 스택을 사용합니다."

#. translators: Gallery template name shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:146
msgid "Detailed Thermal Receipt (58mm)"
msgstr "상세 감열 영수증 (58mm)"

#. translators: Gallery template description shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:148
msgid ""
"Kitchen-sink 58mm receipt: full customer + addresses, tax breakdown, refunds, payments, terms and order barcode."
msgstr "모든 요소를 담은 58mm 영수증: 고객 정보 + 주소, 세금 내역, 환불, 결제, 약관, 주문 바코드."

#. translators: Gallery template name shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:159
msgid "Detailed Thermal Receipt (80mm)"
msgstr "상세 감열 영수증 (80mm)"

#. translators: Gallery template description shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:161
msgid ""
"Kitchen-sink 80mm receipt: full customer + addresses, tax breakdown, refunds, payments, terms and order barcode."
msgstr "모든 요소를 담은 80mm 영수증: 고객 정보 + 주소, 세금 내역, 환불, 결제, 약관, 주문 바코드."

#. translators: Gallery template description shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:174
msgid ""
"Order items only with large font, no pricing. Designed for kitchen display or prep stations."
msgstr "가격 없이 큰 글꼴로 주문 항목만 표시합니다. 주방 디스플레이나 준비 구역용으로 설계되었습니다."

#. translators: Gallery template name shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:185
msgid "Simple Thermal Receipt (58mm)"
msgstr "간단한 감열 영수증 (58mm)"

#. translators: Gallery template description shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:187
msgid ""
"Clean, minimal thermal receipt for narrow 58mm paper. Same layout as 80mm, adjusted for 32-character width."
msgstr "좁은 58mm 용지용 깔끔하고 미니멀한 감열 영수증입니다. 80mm와 같은 레이아웃을 32자 너비에 맞게 조정했습니다."

#. translators: Gallery template name shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:198
msgid "Simple Thermal Receipt (80mm)"
msgstr "간단한 감열 영수증 (80mm)"

#. translators: Gallery template description shown in the admin Template Gallery.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:200
msgid ""
"Clean, minimal thermal receipt for standard 80mm paper. Store header, line items, totals, and barcode."
msgstr "표준 80mm 용지용 깔끔하고 미니멀한 감열 영수증입니다. 매장 헤더, 항목 내역, 합계, 바코드가 포함됩니다."

#. translators: Gallery template name shown in the admin Template Gallery. The (RTL) suffix marks right-to-left layout.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:211
msgid "Simple Thermal Receipt 80mm (RTL)"
msgstr "간단한 감열 영수증 80mm (RTL)"

#. translators: Gallery template description shown in the admin Template Gallery. CP864 / Windows-1256 are printer codepages; keep them verbatim.
#: includes/Templates/Gallery_Registry.php:213
msgid ""
"Right-to-left thermal receipt for 80mm printers. Mirrors column alignments for Arabic, Hebrew, Persian and Urdu. Requires a printer that supports an Arabic codepage (CP864 or Windows-1256) — check your printer's manual before ordering."
msgstr ""
"80mm 프린터용 오른쪽에서 왼쪽(RTL) 감열 영수증입니다. 아랍어, 히브리어, 페르시아어, 우르두어에 맞게 열 정렬을 반전합니다. 아랍어 코드페이지(CP864 또는 Windows-1256)를 지원하는 프린터가 필요합니다. 주문 전에 프린터 설명서를 확인하세요."

